# The sentence spec.Sentence writes for testdata/templates/fix-failing-checks-on-my-prs.json. Rewrite with
# go test ./internal/autopilot/spec -run TestSentenceGolden -update

When checks fail on pull requests in your Authored list, once every check has settled, if it isn't a draft, run "Fix checks" in the background. At most 2 tries per pull request.
